msgstr "状态"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:115
msgid "``todo``, ``ifconfig``, ``extlinks``, ``autosectionlabel``"
msgstr "``todo``\\ , ``ifconfig``\\ , ``extlinks``\\ , ``autosectionlabel``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:116
msgid "Built in. Hardcoded extlinks can receive a suggested role."
msgstr "内置支持。对硬编码的 extlinks 链接，可建议改用角色。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:117
msgid "``graphviz``"
msgstr "``graphviz``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:118
msgid ""
"Linked Graphviz produces static drawings. Resource confinement applies."
msgstr "链接的 Graphviz 库生成静态图形，并遵守资源访问边界。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:119
msgid "``intersphinx``"
msgstr "``intersphinx``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:120
msgid ""
"Local and fetched inventories. Fetching uses the built-in HTTP client."
msgstr "支持本地清单和远程获取的清单。获取时使用内置的 HTTP 客户端。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:121
msgid "``githubpages``"
msgstr "``githubpages``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:122
msgid "Built-in publication files for a static site."
msgstr "内置静态站点所需的发布文件。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:123
msgid "``mathjax`` and ``imgmath``"
msgstr "``mathjax`` 和 ``imgmath``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:124
msgid ""
"HTML mathematics uses MathJax. PDF translates its supported LaTeX subset "
"to Typst."
msgstr "HTML 公式使用 MathJax。PDF 将支持的 LaTeX 子集转换为 Typst。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:125
msgid "``myst_parser``"
msgstr "``myst_parser``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:126
msgid "The implemented project Markdown layer."
msgstr "已实现的项目级 Markdown 层。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:127
msgid "``doctest`` directives"
msgstr "``doctest`` 指令"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:128
msgid "Displayed. The project builder does not execute their tests."
msgstr "显示内容。项目构建器不执行其中的测试。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:129
msgid "``autodoc``"
msgstr "``autodoc``"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:130
msgid "Python source is read without importing or executing the package."
msgstr "读取 Python 源码，不导入或执行包。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:132
msgid ""
"Source-based autodoc cannot discover every object created at runtime. "
"Compiled modules, external decorators, computed values, and extension "
"event hooks have explicit limits. Python 3.13 and the pinned Sphinx "
"documenter tests provide the reference behavior. See :doc:`autodoc` for "
"the full settings and exceptions."
msgstr ""
"基于源码的 autodoc 无法发现所有运行时创建的对象。编译模块、外部装饰器、计算所得的值及扩展事件钩子都有明确限制。参考行为来自 Python "
"3.13 和固定版本的 Sphinx 文档生成器测试。完整设置及例外见 :doc:`autodoc`\\ 。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:137
msgid ""
"``autosummary``, ``napoleon``, ``viewcode``, and arbitrary Python "
"extensions remain outside this route. An unsupported extension named in "
"configuration is reported. An unknown directive or role is reported at "
"its source location. **Its omitted content must be reviewed before "
"publication.** Other theme names are accepted using Guidedog's theme "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"``autosummary``\\ 、\\ ``napoleon``\\ 、\\ ``viewcode`` 和任意 Python "
"扩展不属于这条处理路线。配置中出现不支持的扩展时会报告；未知指令或角色会在源码位置报告。\\ **发布之前必须检查被省略的内容。**\\ "
"其他主题名称会被接受，但使用 Guidedog 自有的主题实现。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:143
msgid "Trust and resource limits"
msgstr "信任与资源限制"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:146
msgid ""
"A normal build accepts the project's raw HTML and Typst, templates, and "
"network inventories. Local reads stay within the source directory and "
"explicitly shared roots. A symlink does not grant access outside that "
"boundary. Templates, static files, includes, images, fonts, and API "
"sources obey the same rule."
msgstr ""
"普通构建接受项目的原始 "
"HTML、Typst、模板和网络清单。本地读取限于源目录及明确共享的根目录。符号链接不能扩大权限。模板、静态文件、include、图片、字体和 "
"API 源码均遵守同一规则。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:151
msgid ""
"Graphviz image resources are resolved relative to their document and "
"confined. Supported image bytes are embedded in the drawing. "
"``imagepath`` and ``fontpath`` do not expand the boundary. Typst runs "
"with a private root containing the readable folders. This keeps book "
"templates and preambles within the declared resources."
msgstr ""
"Graphviz 图片资源相对于所属文档解析，并受路径边界限制。支持的图片数据会嵌入图形。\\ ``imagepath`` 和 "
"``fontpath`` 不会扩大边界。Typst 在包含可读目录的专用根目录中运行，确保图书模板及前置内容仅访问声明的资源。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:156
msgid ""
"``--untrusted`` narrows the read boundary to the source folder. It omits "
"raw content, unsafe URLs, outside resources, project Typst templates, and "
"preambles, with diagnostics. It fetches no inventories or Typst packages. "
"Graphs that ask to read resources are shown as code with a warning. This "
"mode does not bound the native compiler's memory or execution time."
msgstr ""
"``--untrusted`` 将读取范围缩至源目录，省略原始内容、不安全 URL、外部资源、项目 Typst "
"模板和前置内容，并给出诊断。它不获取清单或 Typst 包。请求读取资源的图表会以代码显示，并给出警告。此模式不限制原生编译器的内存或运行时间。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:162
msgid ""
"The host budget defaults to 1 GiB. It is coarse: it counts the sources, "
"included files, and PDF output the host holds, reserved before they are "
"read. Each worker reuses one workspace. The retained project graph and "
"catalogs still consume memory as the project grows. Reading workers "
"coordinate admission. A refused request reports the failing operation and "
"a budget that fits. ``GUIDEDOG_AVAILABLE_MIB`` can supply known machine "
"headroom. The Odin implementation's disk-backed working memory "
"(``--memory=disk``, ``--disk-budget``) is not part of the Rust "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"主机预算默认为 1 GiB。这是一个粗粒度的预算：它统计主机持有的源文件、被包含的文件和 PDF "
"输出，并在读取之前预留。每个工作线程复用同一个工作区。随着项目增大，保留的项目图和清单仍会占用内存。读取工作线程协调准入。请求被拒绝时，会报告失败的操作以及一个够用的预算。可以用 "
"``GUIDEDOG_AVAILABLE_MIB`` 提供已知的机器内存余量。Odin "
"实现中基于磁盘的工作内存（``--memory=disk``、``--disk-budget``）不属于 Rust 实现。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:171
msgid ""
"``--max-depth``, ``--max-nodes``, and ``--stack-kib`` bound document "
"work. Changing a limit invalidates cached reading and output. Depth and "
"stack capacity must agree. Native Graphviz, tree-sitter, and Typst "
"allocations are outside the host budget. We use operating-system limits "
"when those need a hard bound. See :doc:`errors` and "
":doc:`internals/memory`."
msgstr ""
"``--max-depth``、``--max-nodes`` 和 ``--stack-kib`` "
"限制文档处理的工作量。修改限制会使读取缓存和输出缓存失效。深度与栈容量必须匹配。原生 Graphviz、tree-sitter 和 Typst "
"的内存分配不计入主机预算；需要硬性上限时，我们使用操作系统的限制。参见 :doc:`errors` 和 "
":doc:`internals/memory`。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:177
msgid "Verification and real projects"
msgstr "验证与实际项目"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:180
msgid ""
"``cargo xtask sphinxdiff-roots`` compares Guidedog with a pinned Sphinx "
"9.1.0 over 42 of Sphinx's own test roots. It checks pages, identifiers, "
"body links, inventories, numbering, and diagnostics. The run of 15 "
"October 2026 checked the Rust implementation and agrees with the Odin "
"implementation's record on every root but one, where Sphinx itself "
"changed (:doc:`internals/sphinx-comparison`). The stored results explain "
"deliberate differences, for example precise source locations, stable "
"reading-order numbering, and explicit reports for omitted target-specific "
"raw content. The reader conformance tests "
"(:doc:`internals/rst-conformance`, "
":doc:`internals/commonmark-conformance`) keep their expected outputs, and "
"``cargo xtask verify-docutils`` checks those against a pinned Docutils "
"0.22.4: all 98 trees still match."
msgstr ""
"``cargo xtask sphinxdiff-roots`` 在 Sphinx 自身的 42 个测试根目录上，把 Guidedog 与固定版本的 Sphinx 9.1.0 进行对比，检查页面、标识符、正文链接、清单、编号和诊断。2026 年 10 月 15 日的运行检查了 Rust 实现：除一个根目录外，结果与 Odin 实现的记录全部一致，而那个根目录的差异来自 Sphinx 自身的变化（:doc:`internals/sphinx-comparison`）。存储的结果解释了有意保留的差异，例如精确的源码位置、稳定的阅读顺序编号，以及对省略的目标专用原始内容给出明确报告。读取器的一致性测试（:doc:`internals/rst-conformance`、:doc:`internals/commonmark-conformance`）保留了各自的预期输出，``cargo xtask verify-docutils`` 会用固定版本的 Docutils 0.22.4 核对这些输出：98 棵文档树全部仍然一致。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:191
msgid ""
"The remote validation of the Odin implementation on 1 October 2026 ran "
"clean and unchanged HTML and PDF builds for CPython, Django, and Flask. "
"All twelve builds succeeded and retained the baseline diagnostics and "
"link results. It also passed 1,039 Linux tests and 94 targeted "
"AddressSanitizer tests."
msgstr ""
"2026 年 10 月 1 日对 Odin 实现的远程验证中，CPython、Django 和 Flask 的全新构建和无改动构建（HTML 与 "
"PDF）全部完成。十二次构建均成功，诊断和链接结果与基线一致。验证还通过了 1,039 项 Linux 测试和 94 项针对性的 "
"AddressSanitizer 测试。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:196
msgid ""
"Those projects contain unsupported Python extension constructs. Their "
"diagnostics remain part of the evidence. A zero exit status does not mean "
"all their private directives were reproduced. We run with ``-W`` when "
"publishing requires zero diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"这些项目包含不受支持的 Python "
"扩展结构，它们的诊断仍是证据的一部分。退出状态为零并不表示其所有私有指令都已复现。如果发布要求零诊断，我们使用 ``-W`` 运行。"

#: ../../compatibility.rst:201
msgid ""
"The historical measurements and source revisions remain in "
"``docs/manual/evidence/manuals.rst``. They were made with the Odin "
"implementation (release 0.6). User-facing behavior carries over to the "
"Rust implementation, but its timings and memory use must be measured "
"again. These measurements describe the recorded workloads. They are not "
"universal speed or memory bounds."
msgstr ""
"历史测量数据和源码修订记录仍保存在 ``docs/manual/evidence/manuals.rst`` 中。它们是用 Odin 实现（0.6 "
"版）测得的。面向用户的行为沿用到了 Rust 实现，但其耗时和内存占用需要重新测量。这些数据描述的是所记录的工作负载，并非普遍适用的速度或内存上限。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``--memory=ram`` stops at the managed budget. ``--memory=disk`` "
#~ "permits managed working storage to use memory-mapped temporary files. "
#~ "Retained host storage still counts against the RAM budget. "
#~ "``--disk-budget`` bounds the mapped storage; the policy also leaves a "
#~ "disk reserve. A noninteractive command never waits for an answer. "
#~ "``GUIDEDOG_AVAILABLE_MIB`` can supply known machine headroom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``--memory=ram`` 在托管预算达到上限时停止。\\ ``--memory=disk`` "
#~ "允许托管工作存储使用内存映射的临时文件；保留的主机存储仍计入 RAM 预算。\\ ``--disk-budget`` "
#~ "限制映射存储，策略还保留磁盘余量。非交互命令不会等待回答。可通过 ``GUIDEDOG_AVAILABLE_MIB`` "
#~ "提供已知的机器可用容量。"
